@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Home Page";
}

<div class="text-center">
    <h1 class="display-4">Welcome to CINEMAX </h1>
    <p>
        CINEMAX is your home for the best movies across every genre, from every corner of the world.
        You can browse, add, edit, or delete movies, manage genres, and explore reviews all in one clean and easy-to-use platform.
    </p>
    <p>
        We feature movies across genres like Action, Comedy, Drama, Romance, and more. Each movie entry highlights essential details such as the director, release year, and duration — so you can easily discover films that match your taste.
        Whether you’re tracking your favorite films or organizing a watchlist,
        Cinemax helps you keep everything in one place.
        Start by visiting the <a asp-area="" asp-controller="Movies" asp-action="Index">Movies</a> section to explore the full collection
    </p>
    <p>Want to know what others think? Read the <a asp-area="" asp-controller="Reviews" asp-action="Index">Reviews</a> to find out which movies are fan favorites</p>
</div>

<h3>About CINEMAX</h3>
<p>
    Founded in 2024, CINEMAX was created to bring movie lovers together in one place.
    Our platform offers a growing collection of films from every genre from timeless classics
    to the latest blockbusters. Whether you’re searching by director, release year, or duration,
    CINEMAX makes discovering your next favorite movie effortless.
</p>
